{"items":[{"id":"419585724","root":"419585724","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]水姐身上带有一种很温柔的治愈力量，歌声抚慰人心，令人动情。\n每周三晚上都能听到水姐唱歌，真的会有一种幸福感。能因为歌声让大家记住并心怀感激，时时感念于心，这也许也是一名歌手最值得荣耀的所在吧，远比得到一些名利要有价值得多了。[emot=acfun,1734/][/color]","time":1616649253144,"floor":18,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"419579751","root":"419579751","user":{"id":"1031944","name":"胡德号战列巡洋舰","avatar":"b317d86caf776e381094a706"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1729/]昨晚加班没听到，只能补录播了","time":1616643350205,"floor":16,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"419561074","root":"419561074","user":{"id":"3662957","name":"叫我阿浪好了","avatar":"95a0dc614b7e3fd3044b4c67"},"text":"以前听过水姐的大名，我是不知道什么是001的，有一天在灯哥直播间听到灯哥在说洞洞幺来啦，当时只是好奇谁叫这名字，后来才知道洞洞幺就是水姐。再后来看看水姐的投稿、录播，发现水姐唱歌又好听，说话又温柔，真的是爱死了。[emot=acfun,1798/][emot=acfun,1798/][emot=acfun,1798/]","time":1616635197189,"floor":15,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"419562312","root":"419561074","user":{"id":"466587","name":"人生在世无非一日和三餐","avatar":"67ef9cfded74429c27eadcc0"},"text":"主要什么梗水姐都能get√到，像邻居大姐姐一样[emot=acfun,1876/][emot=acfun,1876/]","time":1616635745737,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"419582612","root":"419561074","user":{"id":"47341951","name":"在路丄","avatar":"199eb995da7ebf40d1778772"},"text":"14年的时候在知乎看到过一个问答：国内有哪些值得推荐的翻唱歌姬？当时最高赞的回答里面就提到了水姐，我就是那个时候第一次听到水姐的歌声！","time":1616646167853,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"419559360","root":"419559360","user":{"id":"47341951","name":"在路丄","avatar":"199eb995da7ebf40d1778772"